From 231b3e9b2b7f7d7810c6729dd59b4a1db3ed075d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CONTROL <control@nanolab.local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:40:22 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] chore(engine48): adopt Godot 4.8 generated import
 metadata and script UIDs

Godot 4.8 beta1 texture importer writes three new default import
options (compress/high_quality_mode, mipmaps/preserve_alpha_test_coverage,
mipmaps/alpha_test_threshold) into *.png.import, and generates res://
*.uid sidecars for scripts that were missing them.

This is the additive engine-generated migration adaptation observed on a
cold --headless --editor --import on Ubuntu Linux; import log shows zero
SCRIPT/Parse/Compile errors.
